            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-59871",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "node-tar: node-tar: Denial of Service due to incorrect PAX path handling"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "node-tar is a tar archive manipulation library for Node.js. Prior to 7.5.18, node-tar coerces all-digit PAX path and linkpath values in src/pax.ts to JavaScript numbers, causing downstream path handling such as normalizeWindowsPath(entry.path).split('/') to throw an uncaught TypeError. This issue is fixed in version 7.5.18."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59871",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-59871\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: tar\nFixed Version: 7.5.18\nLink: [CVE-2026-59871](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59871)\nnode-tar is a tar archive manipulation library for Node.js. Prior to 7.5.18, node-tar coerces all-digit PAX path and linkpath values in src/pax.ts to JavaScript numbers, causing downstream path handling such as normalizeWindowsPath(entry.path).split('/') to throw an uncaught TypeError. This issue is fixed in version 7.5.18.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-59871**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|tar|7.5.18|[CVE-2026-59871](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59871)|\n\nnode-tar is a tar archive manipulation library for Node.js. Prior to 7.5.18, node-tar coerces all-digit PAX path and linkpath values in src/pax.ts to JavaScript numbers, causing downstream path handling such as normalizeWindowsPath(entry.path).split('/') to throw an uncaught TypeError. This issue is fixed in version 7.5.18."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 5.3,
                "cvssv3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L",
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.3",
